ermes-agent/issues/38963", "id": 4636118953, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFFWPqQ", "user": {"login": "akinu", "id": 14067391, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDY3Mzkx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14067391?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu", "html_url": "https://github.com/akinu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-05T22:37:19Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-05T22:38:12Z", "body": "+1\nOn Win 11. Git is installed, and can be executed from command line, or powershell, but Hermes cannot find it. Git is not installed on default location, rather in F drive and path is in system path environment variable.", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4636118953/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4639231355", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38963#issuecomment-4639231355", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38963", "id": 4639231355, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFIUNew", "user": {"login": "akinu", "id": 14067391, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjE0MDY3Mzkx", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14067391?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu", "html_url": "https://github.com/akinu", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/akinu/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-06T14:36:04Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-06T14:55:47Z", "body": "Resolved git issue:\nApparently git missing error is not the actual issue. Hermes needs access to bash.exe which is was not in the path. I resolved the issue by copying bash.exe from f:\\git\\bin to f:\\git\\cmd.\n\nThen got stuck hermes at 94%, it appears that web front end needed to built manually:\n\ncd C:\\Users\\<user_name>\\AppData\\Local\\hermes\\hermes-agent\\web\nnpm run build\n\nRestart hermes desktop\n\nAnd for custom end point I had to use CLI (hermes model) to configure the model. and restart hermes\n", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4639231355/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4641310766", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38963#issuecomment-4641310766", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38963", "id": 4641310766, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFKTILg", "user": {"login": "web4zn", "id": 10208505, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjA4NTA1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10208505?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn", "html_url": "https://github.com/web4zn", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-07T03:32:31Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-07T03:32:31Z", "body": "> Resolved git issue: Apparently git missing error is not the actual issue. Hermes needs access to bash.exe which is was not in the path. I resolved the issue by copying bash.exe from f:\\git\\bin to f:\\git\\cmd.\n> \n> Then got stuck hermes at 94%, it appears that web front end needed to built manually:\n> \n> cd C:\\Users<user_name>\\AppData\\Local\\hermes\\hermes-agent\\web npm run build\n> \n> Restart hermes desktop\n> \n> And for custom end point I had to use CLI (hermes model) to configure the model. and restart hermes\n\n<img width=\"527\" height=\"563\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7c57962b-5657-41c8-b925-b5c4388abfee\" />\nI did actually using git cmd. \nSomehow desktop can be opened on 6.6.\nBut after upgrade on 6.7, it start report no git again", "author_association": "NONE", "pin": null, "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4641310766/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "performed_via_github_app": null, "minimized": null}, {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/comments/4641317063", "html_url": "https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38963#issuecomment-4641317063", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/NousResearch/hermes-agent/issues/38963", "id": 4641317063, "node_id": "IC_kwDOPRF1G88AAAABFKTgxw", "user": {"login": "web4zn", "id": 10208505, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEwMjA4NTA1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10208505?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn", "html_url": "https://github.com/web4zn", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/web4zn/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "created_at": "2026-06-07T03:35:56Z", "updated_at": "2026-06-07T03:35:56Z", "body": "> Resolved git issue: Apparently git missing error is not the actual issue. Hermes needs access to bash.exe which is was not in the path. I resolved the issue by copying bash.exe from f:\\git\\bin to f:\\git\\cmd.\n> \n> Then got stuck hermes at 94%, 